<title>INDIA: India 96/97 car output, sales detailed.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 car output, sales detailed.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are detailed</p>
<p>figures of production and sales of cars in 1996/97</p>
<p>(April-March) provided by the Association of Indian Automobile</p>
<p>Manufacturers (AIAM) in a monthly statement.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> CAR PRODUCTION &amp; SALES	  (number of units)</p>
<p>   Companies			  PRODUCTION</p>
<p>			     Apr 96-Mar 97  Apr 95-Mar 96</p>
<p>   DCM DAEWOO		  15,547	    9,155</p>
<p>   GENERAL MOTORS	     7,482		nil</p>
<p>   HINDUSTAN MOTORS	  25,412	   28,152</p>
<p>   MERCEDES BENZ		1,649	    1,051</p>
<p>   MARUTI UDYOG	     328,848	  268,756</p>
<p>   PAL PEUGEOT		  8,887	   10,306</p>
<p>   PREMIER AUTO		 8,802	   20,322</p>
<p>   TELCO			  7,413	   10,498</p>
<p>   TOTAL			404,040	  348,240</p>
<p>- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -</p>
<p>					     SALES</p>
<p>			     Apr 96-Mar 97  Apr 95-Mar 96</p>
<p>   DCM DAEWOO		  16,866	    9,045</p>
<p>   GENERAL MOTORS	     7,482		nil</p>
<p>   HINDUSTAN MOTORS	  25,828	   27,720</p>
<p>   MERCEDES BENZ		1,885		387</p>
<p>   MARUTI UDYOG	     330,414	  267,020</p>
<p>   PAL PEUGOT		   7,659	   10,301</p>
<p>   PREMIER AUTO		 8,792	   20,340</p>
<p>   PREMIER AUTO (UNO)	 1,458		nil</p>
<p>   TELCO			  7,315	   10,527</p>
<p>   MAHINDRA FORD		3,606		nil</p>
<p>   TOTAL			411,305	  345,340</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>SOURCE: Association of Indian Automobile Manufacturers</p>
<p>NOTE : Daewoo's production figures are up to December 1996.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi Newsroom +91-11 301-2024</p>
</text>
